<p>Lay a concealed web (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 16, 21, 26, 30</acronym> detect 'power', <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15, 21, 26, 31, 35</acronym> disarm 'power') under yourself that lasts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15, 20, 25, 30, 35</acronym> turns and pins all non-spiderkin that pass through it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.  The web weakens over time.</p>